{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都リアルミート&グリート"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張リアルミート&グリート"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "足を運んでくださった皆さん、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました〜！！！🎊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて頂き、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXH8l43.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXVEkeq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は白いワンピース〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobmusVm5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このワンピース着るの楽しみだったんだ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山褒めてもらえて嬉しかった！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEFDGbw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobuxLR4p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あいりたん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真撮ってたら来てくれた〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おっきいリボンついててかわいかった☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobgQEgXo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水色系のお洋服あんまり着ないかも〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って思って水色の洋服着てみた日。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobmVrSsr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちらっ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒くていっぱいスープ飲んでた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "強風の中きてくれてありがとう、、！！🌬️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなに会えて安心したよ〜。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobMkKvPm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日のれいなちゃんの洋服のテーマ聞いてみたら面白かった☺︎🤫"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobl7xWOa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobCml2pO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "祝花も！！🌸"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートとかサイリウムカラーとかメッセージとかとか…！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山愛の感じるお花たちだね〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして少し遅くなってしまいましたが、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『池上彰のニュースそうだったのか！！』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "に小田倉麗奈と出演させて頂きました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんとにほんとに緊張したけど！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいなちゃんは頼もしくて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山知ることだらけだったので授業を受ける感覚で楽しく収録に参加させていただきました〜☺︎📚✒️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月9日までTVerで見逃し配信されているのでぜひみてね。📺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日のブログはここまで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねぇ。"}], "source": "official"}